# The pad's Back and Start. In play they are Joy5 and Joy7 with DefUser.ini's bindings: Back shows the scores, Start
# opens the menus. While the menus are up and the pad has their cursor, Back is Escape (the probes after a Back and
# after the keyboard's Escape must agree) and Start is Enter. Start a map, e.g.
# 'DM-Deck16][?Game=Botpack.DeathMatchPlus'.
waitlog up for play
sleep 3
pad attach
sleep 1
probe play
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 0.5
probe back-in-play
pad button start 1
pad button start 0
sleep 1
probe start-in-play
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe pad-back-1
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe pad-back-2
pad button start 1
pad button start 0
sleep 1
probe start-again
key Escape 1
key Escape 0
sleep 1
probe key-escape-1
key Escape 1
key Escape 0
sleep 1
probe key-escape-2
key Escape 1
key Escape 0
sleep 1
probe key-escape-3
pad button start 1
pad button start 0
sleep 0.5
probe pad-start-in-menus
